    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a medieval test of skill and patience! In Pogo Knight, you'll guide a valiant knight through treacherous environments, armed with nothing but a trusty(and bouncy) pogo sword! Your mission: navigate these challenging terrains, overcome dangerous obstacles and reach the crown to claim your title as king.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Precision Pogoing: Master the art of bouncing with your pogo sword, timing and direction are key to conquering overwhelming obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging 3D landscapes: Explore a variety of unique environments, such as towering castles and treacherous sewers designed to push your skill to the limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic Checkpoints: Hit crucial checkpoints to save your progress and reduce the sting of each fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Epic Knightly Aesthetic: Armour-Clad and determined, our knight bounces into battle with a noble cause, ascending to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to guide the knight to victory, or will the challenge ahead prove too daunting? </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a medieval test of skill and patience! In Pogo Knight, you'll guide a valiant knight through treacherous environments, armed with nothing but a trusty(and bouncy) pogo sword! Your mission: navigate these challenging terrains, overcome dangerous obstacles and reach the crown to claim your title as king.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Precision Pogoing: Master the art of bouncing with your pogo sword, timing and direction are key to conquering overwhelming obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging 3D landscapes: Explore a variety of unique environments, such as towering castles and treacherous sewers designed to push your skill to the limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic Checkpoints: Hit crucial checkpoints to save your progress and reduce the sting of each fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Epic Knightly Aesthetic: Armour-Clad and determined, our knight bounces into battle with a noble cause, ascending to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to guide the knight to victory, or will the challenge ahead prove too daunting? </p>",
    "short_description": "Bounce your way to the top and claim victory... How hard could it be?",
